*> Classical hypothesis tests (t, rank, ANOVA, correlation, variance, normality,
*> contingency and proportion tests) on the iris measurements.
*> CMD: just TARGET=hypothesis_tests_ex run-cobol
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. HYPOTHESIS-TESTS-EX.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY "datamunge.cpy".

*> Samples: a count and up to 150 values each.
01 SAMPLE.
   05 SAMPLE-N USAGE BINARY-LONG.
   05 SAMPLE-V USAGE COMP-2 OCCURS 150.
01 SETOSA-PETAL.
   05 SETOSA-PETAL-N USAGE BINARY-LONG.
   05 SETOSA-PETAL-V USAGE COMP-2 OCCURS 150.
01 VERSICOLOR-PETAL.
   05 VERSICOLOR-PETAL-N USAGE BINARY-LONG.
   05 VERSICOLOR-PETAL-V USAGE COMP-2 OCCURS 150.
01 VIRGINICA-PETAL.
   05 VIRGINICA-PETAL-N USAGE BINARY-LONG.
   05 VIRGINICA-PETAL-V USAGE COMP-2 OCCURS 150.
01 SETOSA-SEPAL.
   05 SETOSA-SEPAL-N USAGE BINARY-LONG.
   05 SETOSA-SEPAL-V USAGE COMP-2 OCCURS 150.
01 ALL-PETAL.
   05 ALL-PETAL-N USAGE BINARY-LONG.
   05 ALL-PETAL-V USAGE COMP-2 OCCURS 150.
01 SEPAL-LENGTH.
   05 SEPAL-LENGTH-N USAGE BINARY-LONG.
   05 SEPAL-LENGTH-V USAGE COMP-2 OCCURS 150.
01 PETAL-LENGTH.
   05 PETAL-LENGTH-N USAGE BINARY-LONG.
   05 PETAL-LENGTH-V USAGE COMP-2 OCCURS 150.
01 SORTED-PETAL.
   05 SORTED-ENTRY OCCURS 150.
      10 SORTED-V USAGE COMP-2.

01 IRIS        USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 NROWS       USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 ROW         USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 VEC         USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 VEC-X       USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 VEC-Y       USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 SIZES       USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 RESULT      USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 COLUMN-NAME PIC X(32).
01 SPECIES     PIC X(32).
01 TEST-LABEL  PIC X(64).
01 I           USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 MEDIAN-ALL  USAGE COMP-2.
01 LONG-COUNT  USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 SETOSA-LONG       USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 SETOSA-SHORT      USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 VERSICOLOR-LONG   USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 VERSICOLOR-SHORT  USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 NUM-EDIT    PIC Z(8)9.
01 NUM-EDIT-2  PIC Z(8)9.
01 NUM-EDIT-3  PIC Z(8)9.
01 NUM-EDIT-4  PIC Z(8)9.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    CALL "dm_data_iris" USING DM-DATA-IRIS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DATA-IRIS-RESULT TO IRIS
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NROWS-SELF
    CALL "dm_data_frame_nrows" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-NROWS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NROWS-RESULT TO NROWS

    MOVE "Petal.Length" TO COLUMN-NAME
    MOVE "setosa" TO SPECIES
    PERFORM COLUMN-FOR-SPECIES
    MOVE SAMPLE TO SETOSA-PETAL
    MOVE "versicolor" TO SPECIES
    PERFORM COLUMN-FOR-SPECIES
    MOVE SAMPLE TO VERSICOLOR-PETAL
    MOVE "virginica" TO SPECIES
    PERFORM COLUMN-FOR-SPECIES
    MOVE SAMPLE TO VIRGINICA-PETAL

    DISPLAY "=================== t-tests: petal length, setosa vs. versicolor ==================="
    MOVE SETOSA-PETAL TO SAMPLE
    PERFORM SAMPLE-TO-VECTOR
    MOVE VEC TO VEC-X
    MOVE VERSICOLOR-PETAL TO SAMPLE
    PERFORM SAMPLE-TO-VECTOR
    MOVE VEC TO VEC-Y
    MOVE VEC-X TO DM-T-TEST-TWO-SAMPLE-X
    MOVE VEC-Y TO DM-T-TEST-TWO-SAMPLE-Y
    CALL "dm_t_test_two_sample" USING DM-T-TEST-TWO-SAMPLE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-T-TEST-TWO-SAMPLE-RESULT TO RESULT
    MOVE "Welch two-sample t-test" TO TEST-LABEL
    PERFORM PRINT-RESULT
    MOVE VEC-X TO DM-WILCOXON-RANK-SUM-TEST-X
    MOVE VEC-Y TO DM-WILCOXON-RANK-SUM-TEST-Y
    CALL "dm_wilcoxon_rank_sum_test" USING DM-WILCOXON-RANK-SUM-TEST DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-WILCOXON-RANK-SUM-TEST-RESULT TO RESULT
    MOVE "Wilcoxon rank-sum test" TO TEST-LABEL
    PERFORM PRINT-RESULT
    PERFORM CLOSE-X-Y

    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "=================== One-way ANOVA / Kruskal-Wallis across all 3 species ==================="
    *> All petal lengths, grouped by species, with the group sizes alongside.
    MOVE 0 TO ALL-PETAL-N
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > SETOSA-PETAL-N
        ADD 1 TO ALL-PETAL-N
        MOVE SETOSA-PETAL-V(I) TO ALL-PETAL-V(ALL-PETAL-N)
    END-PERFORM
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > VERSICOLOR-PETAL-N
        ADD 1 TO ALL-PETAL-N
        MOVE VERSICOLOR-PETAL-V(I) TO ALL-PETAL-V(ALL-PETAL-N)
    END-PERFORM
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > VIRGINICA-PETAL-N
        ADD 1 TO ALL-PETAL-N
        MOVE VIRGINICA-PETAL-V(I) TO ALL-PETAL-V(ALL-PETAL-N)
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE ALL-PETAL TO SAMPLE
    PERFORM SAMPLE-TO-VECTOR
    MOVE VEC TO VEC-X
    MOVE 3 TO DM-VECTOR-ULONG-TABLE-COUNT
    MOVE SETOSA-PETAL-N TO DM-VECTOR-ULONG-TABLE-ITEM(1)
    MOVE VERSICOLOR-PETAL-N TO DM-VECTOR-ULONG-TABLE-ITEM(2)
    MOVE VIRGINICA-PETAL-N TO DM-VECTOR-ULONG-TABLE-ITEM(3)
    CALL "dm_vector_ulong_from_table" USING DM-VECTOR-ULONG-TABLE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-ULONG-TABLE-SELF TO SIZES
    MOVE VEC-X TO DM-ONE-WAY-ANOVA-VALUES
    MOVE SIZES TO DM-ONE-WAY-ANOVA-GROUP-SIZES
    CALL "dm_one_way_anova" USING DM-ONE-WAY-ANOVA DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-ONE-WAY-ANOVA-RESULT TO RESULT
    MOVE "One-way ANOVA" TO TEST-LABEL
    PERFORM PRINT-RESULT
    MOVE VEC-X TO DM-KRUSKAL-WALLIS-TEST-VALUES
    MOVE SIZES TO DM-KRUSKAL-WALLIS-TEST-GROUP-SIZES
    CALL "dm_kruskal_wallis_test" USING DM-KRUSKAL-WALLIS-TEST DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-KRUSKAL-WALLIS-TEST-RESULT TO RESULT
    MOVE "Kruskal-Wallis" TO TEST-LABEL
    PERFORM PRINT-RESULT
    MOVE VEC-X TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE SIZES TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS

    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "=================== Correlation: sepal length vs. petal length ==================="
    MOVE NROWS TO SEPAL-LENGTH-N PETAL-LENGTH-N
    PERFORM VARYING ROW FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL ROW >= NROWS
        MOVE "Sepal.Length" TO COLUMN-NAME
        PERFORM NUMERIC-AT
        MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-RESULT TO SEPAL-LENGTH-V(ROW + 1)
        MOVE "Petal.Length" TO COLUMN-NAME
        PERFORM NUMERIC-AT
        MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-RESULT TO PETAL-LENGTH-V(ROW + 1)
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE SEPAL-LENGTH TO SAMPLE
    PERFORM SAMPLE-TO-VECTOR
    MOVE VEC TO VEC-X
    MOVE PETAL-LENGTH TO SAMPLE
    PERFORM SAMPLE-TO-VECTOR
    MOVE VEC TO VEC-Y
    MOVE VEC-X TO DM-PEARSON-CORRELATION-TEST-X
    MOVE VEC-Y TO DM-PEARSON-CORRELATION-TEST-Y
    CALL "dm_pearson_correlation_test" USING DM-PEARSON-CORRELATION-TEST DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-PEARSON-CORRELATION-TEST-RESULT TO RESULT
    MOVE "Pearson correlation" TO TEST-LABEL
    PERFORM PRINT-RESULT
    MOVE VEC-X TO DM-SPEARMAN-CORRELATION-TEST-X
    MOVE VEC-Y TO DM-SPEARMAN-CORRELATION-TEST-Y
    CALL "dm_spearman_correlation_test" USING DM-SPEARMAN-CORRELATION-TEST DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-SPEARMAN-CORRELATION-TEST-RESULT TO RESULT
    MOVE "Spearman correlation" TO TEST-LABEL
    PERFORM PRINT-RESULT
    PERFORM CLOSE-X-Y

    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "=================== F-test: petal length variance, setosa vs. virginica ==================="
    MOVE SETOSA-PETAL TO SAMPLE
    PERFORM SAMPLE-TO-VECTOR
    MOVE VEC TO VEC-X
    MOVE VIRGINICA-PETAL TO SAMPLE
    PERFORM SAMPLE-TO-VECTOR
    MOVE VEC TO VEC-Y
    MOVE VEC-X TO DM-F-TEST-VARIANCE-X
    MOVE VEC-Y TO DM-F-TEST-VARIANCE-Y
    CALL "dm_f_test_variance" USING DM-F-TEST-VARIANCE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-F-TEST-VARIANCE-RESULT TO RESULT
    MOVE "F test" TO TEST-LABEL
    PERFORM PRINT-RESULT
    PERFORM CLOSE-X-Y

    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "=================== Normality: is sepal length normally distributed within setosa? ==================="
    MOVE "Sepal.Length" TO COLUMN-NAME
    MOVE "setosa" TO SPECIES
    PERFORM COLUMN-FOR-SPECIES
    MOVE SAMPLE TO SETOSA-SEPAL
    PERFORM SAMPLE-TO-VECTOR
    MOVE VEC TO VEC-X
    MOVE VEC-X TO DM-SHAPIRO-FRANCIA-TEST-X
    CALL "dm_shapiro_francia_test" USING DM-SHAPIRO-FRANCIA-TEST DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-SHAPIRO-FRANCIA-TEST-RESULT TO RESULT
    MOVE "Shapiro-Francia" TO TEST-LABEL
    PERFORM PRINT-RESULT
    MOVE VEC-X TO DM-KS-TEST-ONE-SAMPLE-NORMAL-X
    MOVE 3 TO DM-KS-TEST-ONE-SAMPLE-NORMAL-GIVEN
    MOVE 5.006 TO DM-KS-TEST-ONE-SAMPLE-NORMAL-MEAN
    MOVE 0.3525 TO DM-KS-TEST-ONE-SAMPLE-NORMAL-SD
    CALL "dm_ks_test_one_sample_normal" USING DM-KS-TEST-ONE-SAMPLE-NORMAL DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-KS-TEST-ONE-SAMPLE-NORMAL-RESULT TO RESULT
    MOVE "KS vs. fitted normal" TO TEST-LABEL
    PERFORM PRINT-RESULT
    MOVE VEC-X TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS

    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "=================== Chi-squared / Fisher: is petal length "
        QUOTE "long" QUOTE " independent of species? ==================="
    *> The median of all petal lengths: the upper middle value after sorting.
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > ALL-PETAL-N
        MOVE ALL-PETAL-V(I) TO SORTED-V(I)
    END-PERFORM
    SORT SORTED-ENTRY ON ASCENDING KEY SORTED-V
    COMPUTE I = ALL-PETAL-N / 2 + 1
    MOVE SORTED-V(I) TO MEDIAN-ALL
    MOVE SETOSA-PETAL TO SAMPLE
    PERFORM COUNT-LONG
    MOVE LONG-COUNT TO SETOSA-LONG
    COMPUTE SETOSA-SHORT = SETOSA-PETAL-N - SETOSA-LONG
    MOVE VERSICOLOR-PETAL TO SAMPLE
    PERFORM COUNT-LONG
    MOVE LONG-COUNT TO VERSICOLOR-LONG
    COMPUTE VERSICOLOR-SHORT = VERSICOLOR-PETAL-N - VERSICOLOR-LONG
    MOVE SETOSA-LONG TO NUM-EDIT
    MOVE SETOSA-SHORT TO NUM-EDIT-2
    MOVE VERSICOLOR-LONG TO NUM-EDIT-3
    MOVE VERSICOLOR-SHORT TO NUM-EDIT-4
    DISPLAY "table: setosa=[" FUNCTION TRIM(NUM-EDIT) "," FUNCTION TRIM(NUM-EDIT-2)
        "] versicolor=[" FUNCTION TRIM(NUM-EDIT-3) "," FUNCTION TRIM(NUM-EDIT-4) "]"
    MOVE 4 TO SAMPLE-N
    MOVE SETOSA-LONG TO SAMPLE-V(1)
    MOVE SETOSA-SHORT TO SAMPLE-V(2)
    MOVE VERSICOLOR-LONG TO SAMPLE-V(3)
    MOVE VERSICOLOR-SHORT TO SAMPLE-V(4)
    PERFORM SAMPLE-TO-VECTOR
    MOVE VEC TO DM-CHI-SQUARED-TEST-INDEPENDENCE-TABLE
    MOVE 2 TO DM-CHI-SQUARED-TEST-INDEPENDENCE-NROWS
    MOVE 2 TO DM-CHI-SQUARED-TEST-INDEPENDENCE-NCOLS
    CALL "dm_chi_squared_test_independence" USING DM-CHI-SQUARED-TEST-INDEPENDENCE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-CHI-SQUARED-TEST-INDEPENDENCE-RESULT TO RESULT
    MOVE "Chi-squared independence" TO TEST-LABEL
    PERFORM PRINT-RESULT
    MOVE VEC TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE SETOSA-LONG TO DM-FISHER-EXACT-TEST-2X2-A
    MOVE SETOSA-SHORT TO DM-FISHER-EXACT-TEST-2X2-B
    MOVE VERSICOLOR-LONG TO DM-FISHER-EXACT-TEST-2X2-C
    MOVE VERSICOLOR-SHORT TO DM-FISHER-EXACT-TEST-2X2-D
    CALL "dm_fisher_exact_test_2x2" USING DM-FISHER-EXACT-TEST-2X2 DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-FISHER-EXACT-TEST-2X2-RESULT TO RESULT
    MOVE "Fisher's exact test" TO TEST-LABEL
    PERFORM PRINT-RESULT

    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "=================== Proportion / binomial: fraction of "
        QUOTE "long" QUOTE " petals overall ==================="
    MOVE ALL-PETAL TO SAMPLE
    PERFORM COUNT-LONG
    MOVE LONG-COUNT TO DM-PROPORTION-TEST-ONE-SAMPLE-SUCCESSES
    MOVE ALL-PETAL-N TO DM-PROPORTION-TEST-ONE-SAMPLE-N
    MOVE 3 TO DM-PROPORTION-TEST-ONE-SAMPLE-GIVEN
    MOVE 0.5 TO DM-PROPORTION-TEST-ONE-SAMPLE-P
    CALL "dm_proportion_test_one_sample" USING DM-PROPORTION-TEST-ONE-SAMPLE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-PROPORTION-TEST-ONE-SAMPLE-RESULT TO RESULT
    MOVE "One-sample proportion test (vs 0.5)" TO TEST-LABEL
    PERFORM PRINT-RESULT
    MOVE LONG-COUNT TO DM-BINOMIAL-TEST-SUCCESSES
    MOVE ALL-PETAL-N TO DM-BINOMIAL-TEST-N
    MOVE 3 TO DM-BINOMIAL-TEST-GIVEN
    MOVE 0.5 TO DM-BINOMIAL-TEST-P
    CALL "dm_binomial_test" USING DM-BINOMIAL-TEST DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-BINOMIAL-TEST-RESULT TO RESULT
    MOVE "Exact binomial test (vs 0.5)" TO TEST-LABEL
    PERFORM PRINT-RESULT

    MOVE IRIS TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    STOP RUN.

*> Prints the HypothesisTestResult RESULT on one line after TEST-LABEL, then closes it.
PRINT-RESULT.
    MOVE RESULT TO DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-STATISTIC-SELF
    CALL "dm_hypothesis_test_result_statistic_get" USING DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-STATISTIC DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(TEST-LABEL) ": statistic=" DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-STATISTIC-VALUE
        WITH NO ADVANCING
    MOVE RESULT TO DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-PARAMETER1-SELF
    CALL "dm_hypothesis_test_result_parameter1_get" USING DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-PARAMETER1 DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    IF DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-PARAMETER1-VALUE NOT = 0
        DISPLAY ", df1=" DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-PARAMETER1-VALUE WITH NO ADVANCING
    END-IF
    MOVE RESULT TO DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-PARAMETER2-SELF
    CALL "dm_hypothesis_test_result_parameter2_get" USING DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-PARAMETER2 DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    IF DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-PARAMETER2-VALUE NOT = 0
        DISPLAY ", df2=" DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-PARAMETER2-VALUE WITH NO ADVANCING
    END-IF
    MOVE RESULT TO DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-P-VALUE-SELF
    CALL "dm_hypothesis_test_result_p_value_get" USING DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-P-VALUE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE RESULT TO DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-ALTERNATIVE-SELF
    CALL "dm_hypothesis_test_result_alternative_get" USING DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-ALTERNATIVE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    DISPLAY ", p=" DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-P-VALUE-VALUE " (" WITH NO ADVANCING
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-ALTERNATIVE-VALUE-LESS
            DISPLAY "less)" WITH NO ADVANCING
        WHEN DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-ALTERNATIVE-VALUE-GREATER
            DISPLAY "greater)" WITH NO ADVANCING
        WHEN OTHER
            DISPLAY "two.sided)" WITH NO ADVANCING
    END-EVALUATE
    MOVE RESULT TO DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-HAS-CONF-INT-SELF
    CALL "dm_hypothesis_test_result_has_conf_int_get" USING DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-HAS-CONF-INT DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    IF DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-HAS-CONF-INT-VALUE = 1
        MOVE RESULT TO DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-CONF-INT-LOWER-SELF
        CALL "dm_hypothesis_test_result_conf_int_lower_get" USING DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-CONF-INT-LOWER DM-STATUS
        PERFORM CHECK
        MOVE RESULT TO DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-CONF-INT-UPPER-SELF
        CALL "dm_hypothesis_test_result_conf_int_upper_get" USING DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-CONF-INT-UPPER DM-STATUS
        PERFORM CHECK
        DISPLAY ", CI=[" DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-CONF-INT-LOWER-VALUE ", "
            DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-CONF-INT-UPPER-VALUE "]" WITH NO ADVANCING
    END-IF
    MOVE RESULT TO DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-METHOD-SELF
    CALL "dm_hypothesis_test_result_method_get" USING DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-METHOD DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    DISPLAY " -- " DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-METHOD-VALUE(1:DM-HYPOTHESIS-TEST-RESULT-METHOD-VALUE-LENGTH)
    MOVE RESULT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS.

*> SAMPLE gets the COLUMN-NAME values of the iris rows whose Species is SPECIES.
COLUMN-FOR-SPECIES.
    MOVE 0 TO SAMPLE-N
    PERFORM VARYING ROW FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL ROW >= NROWS
        MOVE IRIS TO DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-SELF
        MOVE "Species" TO DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-COLUMN-NAME
        MOVE ROW TO DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-ROW-INDEX
        CALL "dm_data_frame_string_at" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT DM-STATUS
        PERFORM CHECK
        IF DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-RESULT(1:DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-RESULT-LENGTH) = SPECIES
            PERFORM NUMERIC-AT
            ADD 1 TO SAMPLE-N
            MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-RESULT TO SAMPLE-V(SAMPLE-N)
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM.

*> Reads iris COLUMN-NAME at ROW into DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-RESULT.
NUMERIC-AT.
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-SELF
    MOVE COLUMN-NAME TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-COLUMN-NAME
    MOVE ROW TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-ROW-INDEX
    CALL "dm_data_frame_numeric_at" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK.

*> VEC gets a new VECTOR-DOUBLE holding the SAMPLE values.
SAMPLE-TO-VECTOR.
    MOVE SAMPLE-N TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-COUNT
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > SAMPLE-N
        MOVE SAMPLE-V(I) TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-ITEM(I)
    END-PERFORM
    CALL "dm_vector_double_from_table" USING DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-SELF TO VEC.

*> LONG-COUNT gets the number of SAMPLE values above MEDIAN-ALL.
COUNT-LONG.
    MOVE 0 TO LONG-COUNT
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > SAMPLE-N
        IF SAMPLE-V(I) > MEDIAN-ALL
            ADD 1 TO LONG-COUNT
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM.

CLOSE-X-Y.
    MOVE VEC-X TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE VEC-Y TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS.

*> Stops with the error after a failed call.
CHECK.
    IF NOT DM-STATUS-OK
        DISPLAY "datamunge error (" FUNCTION TRIM(DM-STATUS-KIND) "): "
            DM-STATUS-MESSAGE(1:DM-STATUS-LENGTH) UPON SYSERR
        STOP RUN RETURNING 1
    END-IF.
